From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Llewellyn-Jones <david@flypig.co.uk>
Date: Sun, 7 Jul 2024 16:28:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 44/67] Regenerate moz.build files. JB#53756

Refresh the WebRTC build integration after adding the Sailfish video
capture module.

Regenerate the video-capture target and root directory list from the
patched GN configuration. This selects the Sailfish camera sources and
omits desktop capture, portal, DRM, GBM, epoxy, and PipeWire targets
without architecture-specific exclusions.

Keep the configured gecko-camera, NSPR, pixman, and libyuv flags
alongside the generated target because GN cannot express Mozilla
configure substitutions.

The generated files were refreshed with:

  ./mach python python/mozbuild/mozbuild/gn_processor.py \
      dom/media/webrtc/third_party_build/gn-configs/webrtc.json

Co-authored-by: Denis Grigorev <d.grigorev@omprussia.ru>
